# TR House Telvanni: "Fools That Meddle" (TR_m1_HT_Va1), the peaceful way. Norahin Darys, a Mouth in the Chambers,
# wants the Temple priest Sevroth Teles out of Port Telvannis ("leave town": "What is that?" 4, then 10; the
# priest's script enables him at 10). Persuaded ("I don't know why they want you gone..." 2, then the descent
# answer 3), he agrees to go (20, his control 10); Norahin, told he has left (Choice 2), pays out (101, +5
# reputation).
# PositionCell and Position stand in for the travel.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ht_mi1_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case ht_va1_start
run
player->PositionCell 275 6977 13830 0 "Port Telvannis, Telvanni Council House: Chambers"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Norahin_Darys"->GetDistance player < 2500
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Norahin_Darys
ask chores
ask leave town
choose 4
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Va1 == 10
bye
end

case ht_va1_priest
run
player->Position 342815 140900 1600 0
until 900 "TR_m1_q67_Va1_Priest"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk TR_m1_q67_Va1_Priest
ask leave town
choose 2
choose 3
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Va1 == 20
bye
end

case ht_va1_done
run
player->PositionCell 275 6977 13830 0 "Port Telvannis, Telvanni Council House: Chambers"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Norahin_Darys"->GetDistance player < 2500
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Norahin_Darys
ask leave town
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Va1 == 101
bye
end
